What is the different between while and for?
If we don't know the iteration well in advance then we can choose while loop.
If we know the iteration  well in advance then we can choose for loop.
To process the linkedlist it is always recommended to use while loop , because size of the linkedlist is not fixed in nature.
To process the array ,it is always recommended to use for loop becaues size of the array is fixed in nature.



